<h3 class="uppercase pixel-font">Up next</h3>
<p class="text-large">I'll publish the articles from the book's Context section on my website, along with the illustrations, under a CC BY-SA license. I hope to finish that soon, and may make them available as a downloadable ebook, too.</p>
<p class="text-large">After that, a short break. Nothing is lined up in the immediate future, and orders are manageable. I'm still shipping, but also taking time to think about what's next for NoGood.</p>
<p class="text-large">I'll keep you posted. Thank you for your support.</p>
